35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The late-turn pool is thinning, and overtime is covering everything.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The late-evening pilot met its cost target, which is surprising.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The pre-war shells have hidden voids, and the ferry data terms are missing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital ledger has a ring-fenced balance, but operating subsidies are trimmed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Most added minutes are from waiting for connections, not paying.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the missing data terms are a big problem for integration.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, so the crowding complaints might be misleading?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, yes, the joint committee never agreed on data.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,The ticketing fees are higher than the paving budget.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"The mid-city runs are slower, but platforms clear at the old rate.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,We need to be careful with night service if the rosters are empty.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"The accessibility programme had mixed results, some lanes were lost.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The contingency pricing is high because of the unrecorded voids.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,We need to be careful about the long-term costs of the fare platform.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"We should focus on the connections, not the ticket machines.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
